{"seq":22,"slug":"staff-plus-engineering","title":"Staff+ 工程师成长","stage":"DONE","category":"cross-discipline","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/staff-plus-engineering","rating":{"composite":3.6,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"staff-工程师成长\">Staff+ 工程师成长</h1><p>很多工程师在拿到「高级工程师」头衔后会撞上一堵看不见的墙：技术越写越熟，晋升却停滞了。原因往往不是代码能力不够，而是更高的层级根本不再用「写代码的产出」来衡量。Staff、Senior Staff、Principal 这一串通常被合称为「Staff+」的职级，考核的是另一套东西——你能不能把一群人、一个组织的技术方向往正确的地方推动。这个 hub 讲的就是从「优秀的执行者」长成「资深个人贡献者」这条路上，到底要补齐哪些认知与能力。</p>\n<p>整个 hub 由四条主线递进组成，对应四个章节。</p>\n<p>第一条是<a href=\"foundations/\">基础</a>：先把 Staff+ 到底是什么讲清楚。它不是「更高级的高级工程师」，而是一种以影响力而非个人产出为衡量单位的角色。这一章建立三个地基概念——Staff+ 角色的本质与「大局观、复杂项目落地、提升周围人」三大支柱，IC 路线与管理路线的真实区别（包括 2026 年的薪酬数据），以及贯穿全 hub 的核心坐标轴「影响力的层级」。</p>\n<p>第二条是<a href=\"archetypes/\">原型</a>：Staff+ 不是单一画像。Will Larson 总结出四种典型原型——技术主管、架构师、解决者、右手。这一章解释这四种原型各自的工作形态、它们如何在「扎根一处」与「四处救火」两个维度上分化，以及无论哪种原型都共享的底层——不依赖管理职权的技术领导力。</p>\n<p>第三条是<a href=\"skills/\">能力</a>：把原型拆成可以刻意练习的具体能力。资深 IC 的杠杆来自三件事——制定能影响多团队的技术战略并在不确定中做决策、跨团队对齐与消化大量「胶水工作」、以及用写作把一个人的判断放大到整个组织。这三者层层咬合：战略需要靠对齐落地，而对齐又高度依赖书面沟通。</p>\n<p>第四条是<a href=\"practice/\">工程实践</a>：把前面的认知落到日常操作。怎么用晋升材料和「Staff 项目」把已经发生的影响显性化、找到为你发声的 sponsor；怎么在职责急剧变宽后管理有限的时间与精力、学会说不；以及如何通过带人和提升团队，把自己变成一个让整支队伍都变强的「乘数」。</p>\n<p>阅读顺序建议从基础读起，因为后面三章反复引用基础章建立的坐标系（尤其是「影响力的层级」与三大支柱）。但如果你已经身处某个具体困境——比如正在准备晋升、或正纠结要不要转管理——也可以直接跳到对应文档，每篇都标注了与其他篇的交叉链接，方便你顺着知识网走。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/staff-plus-engineering/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-staff-plus-role","title":"Staff+ 角色与定位","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/staff-plus-engineering/foundations/the-staff-plus-role"},{"seq":2,"slug":"vs-management-track","title":"与管理路线的区别","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/staff-plus-engineering/foundations/vs-management-track"},{"seq":3,"slug":"scope-of-impact","title":"影响力的层级","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/staff-plus-engineering/foundations/scope-of-impact"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"archetypes","title":"原型","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/staff-plus-engineering/archetypes","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"tech-lead-architect","title":"技术主管与架构师","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/staff-plus-engineering/archetypes/tech-lead-architect"},{"seq":2,"slug":"solver-right-hand","title":"解决者与右手","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/staff-plus-engineering/archetypes/solver-right-hand"},{"seq":3,"slug":"technical-leadership","title":"技术领导力","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/staff-plus-engineering/archetypes/technical-leadership"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"skills","title":"能力","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/staff-plus-engineering/skills","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"technical-strategy","title":"技术战略与决策","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/staff-plus-engineering/skills/technical-strategy"},{"seq":2,"slug":"cross-team-alignment","title":"跨团队协作与对齐","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/staff-plus-engineering/skills/cross-team-alignment"},{"seq":3,"slug":"communication-writing","title":"写作与沟通放大","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/staff-plus-engineering/skills/communication-writing"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"工程实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/staff-plus-engineering/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"promotion-demonstrating-impact","title":"晋升与展示影响","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/staff-plus-engineering/practice/promotion-demonstrating-impact"},{"seq":2,"slug":"time-energy-management","title":"时间与精力管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/staff-plus-engineering/practice/time-energy-management"},{"seq":3,"slug":"mentorship-leveling-up","title":"导师与提升团队","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/staff-plus-engineering/practice/mentorship-leveling-up"}]}]}